sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant E as ESTS
  participant A as Authenticator app
  Note over C,E: Password login returned pgid=ConvergedTFA (Figure 5)
  C->>E: POST /common/SAS/BeginAuth (JSON)  header canary
  Note over C,E: {AuthMethodId: PhoneAppNotification, Method: BeginAuth, ctx: sCtx,<br/>flowToken: sFT}
  E-->>C: 200 {Success: true, Entropy, FlowToken, Ctx, SessionId, ...}
  E-)A: push notification (out of band)
  Note over C,E: Replace working flowToken and ctx with the BeginAuth FlowToken and<br/>Ctx.<br/>Display Entropy for number matching.
  loop poll
    Note over C,E: pollCount = 1, 2, ... up to iMaxPollAttempts, interval<br/>iPollingInterval (about 5 s)
    C->>E: GET<br/>/common/SAS/EndAuth?authMethodId=PhoneAppNotification&pollCount={n}
    Note over C,E: headers x-ms-sessionId ($Config.sessionId), x-ms-flowToken, x-ms-ctx
    E-->>C: 200 {Success: false, ResultValue: AuthenticationPending, Retry:<br/>true}
  end
  A->>E: user approves
  C->>E: GET /common/SAS/EndAuth?...
  E-->>C: 200 {Success: true, FlowToken, Ctx, MobileAppAuthDetails}
  C->>E: POST /common/SAS/ProcessAuth (form)
  Note over C,E: request=Ctx, mfaAuthMethod, login, flowToken, canary
  alt authorization code issued
    E-->>C: 302 Location: {redirect_uri}?code=...
  else interrupt
    E-->>C: 200 HTML (ConvergedProofUpRedirect, KMSI, ...) (Figure 13)
  end
  C->>E: POST /{tenant}/oauth2/token
  E-->>C: 200 access_token, refresh_token, id_token
